{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 19:07:34.558485", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Assessment\\nThe network appears to be experiencing significant connectivity issues. Multiple ping tests from client hosts to DNS servers and web servers have either timed out or resulted in \"Destination Net Unreachable\" errors. This indicates potential routing or reachability problems within the Clos fabric.\\n\\n#### Findings\\n1. **Ping Results:**\\n   - **Client 0:** All ping attempts to web servers (`webserver0_pod0`, `webserver1_pod0`, `webserver2_pod0`) and the DNS server (`dns_pod0`) timed out.\\n   - **Client 1:** Ping attempts to `webserver0_pod1` and `webserver2_pod1` timed out. Ping to `webserver1_pod1` resulted in \"Destination Net Unreachable.\" Similarly, ping to the DNS server (`dns_pod1`) also resulted in \"Destination Net Unreachable.\"\\n\\n2. **Client Network Configuration:**\\n   - **Client 0:**\\n     - IP Address: `192.168.0.2/24`\\n     - Default Gateway: `192.168.0.1`\\n     - Network interface `eth0` is up and configured correctly.\\n   - **Client 1:**\\n     - IP Address: `192.168.1.2/24`\\n     - Default Gateway: `192.168.1.1`\\n     - Network interface `eth0` is up and configured correctly.\\n\\n3. **Routing Issues:**\\n   - Attempts to retrieve the IP routing table from the super spine routers (`super_spine_router_0` and `super_spine_router_1`) failed due to missing `vtysh` command. This prevents further analysis of the routing configuration at the super spine level.\\n\\n#### Observations\\n- The clients are correctly configured with IP addresses and default gateways, but they are unable to reach their respective DNS servers and web servers.\\n- The \"Destination Net Unreachable\" errors suggest that the routing tables in the Clos fabric may be misconfigured or incomplete.\\n- The inability to access routing information from the super spine routers further complicates the diagnosis.\\n\\n#### Next Steps\\nFurther investigation is required to:\\n1. Verify the BGP configurations and routing tables across the Clos fabric, especially at the spine and super spine levels.\\n2. Check for any misconfigurations or failures in the inter-router links and service subnets.\\n3. Analyze logs and counters from the routers and switches to identify anomalies.\\n\\nThis concludes the initial diagnostic report., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='ce02c77d-ddad-486a-a23b-31a0ce2d8780'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
